        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Two aims—the recovery of the city's economy and the modernization of its public transportation system—were in the mayor's mind when she assumed office. The city's decline in unemployment and the increase in sales tax revenue testifies to her success in the first. But continuing traffic problems and bus and subway service delays indicate less success with the second. Nevertheless, the mere promise of future improvements pleased the city's voters.",
            "block_bbox": [
                141,
                712,
                785,
                855
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 9,
            "global_block_id": 9,
            "global_group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    141.0,
                    712.0
                ],
                [
                    785.0,
                    712.0
                ],
                [
                    785.0,
                    855.0
                ],
                [
                    141.0,
                    855.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The components of Abco's profitability, particularly growth in emerging markets, will be highlighted in our report to demonstrate its advantages versus competitors. Revenue returns along several dimensions—product type, end-use, distribution channels, etc.—will provide a basis for this analysis. Likely growth prospects of Abco's newest product lines will depend most on the development of new distribution channels in Africa and the Middle East, according to our projections. A range of innovative strategies will be needed to support the introduction of new products.",
            "block_bbox": [
                141,
                860,
                784,
                1027
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 10,
            "global_block_id": 10,
            "global_group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    141.0,
