                ],
                [
                    141.0,
                    1027.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Both of the film's main characters suffer life-changing losses even though it is billed as a comedy. The only draft of a novel the female lead has been writing for five years is destroyed when her laptop crashes, but a more positive outlook on life ultimately results from this experience. In contrast, when a million-dollar lottery ticket is misplaced by her romantic interest, he sinks into depression and cynicism. The film's comic effect is created by the different ways these characters respond to their similar situations.",
            "block_bbox": [
